      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋaraito ŋuna ke ekiŋaren ka atutubet apei alotooma ŋitomon a ŋiboro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani idolete iyes nakwap ŋina ikiinit Ekapolon Akuj kus iyes aruwor ŋina kus, ido kidaut akituruwor iŋes ŋina kus ka kidaut akiboikin nen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emaikina iyes tolemut alokinyom a daadaŋ ŋaraito ŋuna esyaunak ŋadi ŋuna itaunete iyes anakwap a ŋina ikiini iyes Ekapolon Akuj kus, kiwuakis lobukit, yaasi nakibois ŋina eseuni Ekapolon Akuj kus aruwor neni ilipere iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elosi ŋinituŋanan kus neni esacaradoti a ŋolo eyai lotic apaki ŋin, tolimokis iŋes ebe, “Akoloŋit na, ilimokini iyoŋ Ekapolon Akuj kon atemar adau ayoŋ adolun nakwap ŋina abu Ekapolon kiik atapapaa kosi ainakin isua.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ijaari esacaradoti ebukit anakan kon, ido kiwuak kwap kiŋaren Namuroet ŋina ke Ekapolon Akuj kus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emaikina ŋinituŋanan tolimu ŋakiro nu alokiŋaren Ekapolon Akuj kus, “Arae papaa kaŋ Earameanit ŋolo koloŋ erimit, abu iŋes totiyaar Ijipit kiboi a nen erae egelaanot, akudyoko ŋituŋa keŋ, nai apotu ikes tolalata, toruworos ŋituŋa ŋulu agogoŋok ka ŋulu arwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ikitiŋete isua Ŋijipitian ka aryenyeo ka ikisicanete isua aŋuna ikitiŋakiniata akitiya ŋiticisyo ŋulu agogoŋok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aponi isua kigworokinoe Ekapolon Akuj atapapaa kosi, ido abu Ekapolon kiira akigworo kosi, kiŋolik ŋican kosi, kiŋolik ŋiticisyo ŋulu ikireikinitae isua ka akisicanio ŋina ikisicanitere isua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon ikiyau isua alo Ijipit a apedor keŋ a ŋina etiron ka akiŋarakinet ka a ŋiticisyo a ŋulu apolok nooi a ŋulu etubulok ka ŋakitoodyanakineta ka ŋaumonokineta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido ikiyau isua nakibois na ka ikiinak isua akwap na ajokan na ŋina eleleata ŋakile ka ao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, tokona, okoe Ekapolon ayau ayoŋ ŋaraito ŋuna esyaunak ŋuna a akwap ŋina ikiinak iyoŋ ayoŋ.” Iwuakinete nai iyes ŋainakineta kus kiŋaren Ekapolon Akuj kus, ido kijuuroto kipuro Ekapolon Akuj kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku itiyaete iyes ŋasuban, iyes kaapei ka ŋilepi ka ŋigelaanotin ŋulu iboiyete ka iyes, imujete akimuj daadaŋ ŋina ikiinak iyes Ekapolon Akuj kus ka lotuŋa a ŋikalya kus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kidaut iyes alemun ŋatutubeta ŋapeipei alotooma ŋitomon a ŋikinyom kus alokaru a ŋolo a ŋiuni (a ŋolo erae ekaru ŋolo elemununuyere atutubet apei alotooma ŋitomon) ka kidaut ainakin neni a ŋilepi, a ŋigelaanotin, a ŋikokyok ka neni a ŋapuseru ikotere, imujete ikes daŋ akimuj ŋina itemokino alotaunio kus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilimunete iyes nu alokiŋaren Ekapolon Akuj kus, “Adaun isua alemar anakais kosi atutubet apei a ŋikinyom kosi ŋina italeoritae, adaun isua ainakin ikes neni a ŋilepi, neni a ŋigelaanotin a ŋulu eboiyete alotaunio kosi, neni a ŋikokyok ka neni a ŋapuseru, iwuapitae ŋakiciketa kon daadaŋ ŋuna ibu iyoŋ ikiicik isua akiwuap, nyeŋero isua, kori nyimuryakina isua akiwuap ŋakiciketa kon daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyenyama isua adio a atutubet a ŋina italeoritae, nyinyama isua ikes, apaki ŋina egworore, nyelemara isua ikes apaki ŋina ikitoroniyaritere, nyeinakina isua ikes adio erae ainakinet neni a ŋikatwak. Ewuapi isua ŋakiro ŋuna ke Ekapolon Akuj kosi, etiyae daadaŋ ŋuna ikicik iŋes isua akitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋoliu anakibois kon a ŋina asegan, kiŋoliu anakuj, kiterereŋ ŋituŋa kon Ŋisirael ka ŋalup a akwap a ŋina ikiinak iyoŋ isua, lopite ŋolo ibunio iyoŋ kikoŋio neni atapapaa kosi, kiterereŋ akwap kosi ŋina eleleata ŋakile ka ao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akitatam ŋina esidyon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit napei na ikicik iyes Ekapolon akiwuap ŋakiro ŋuna etubunitoe ŋun ka ŋikisila ŋul, kiwuapa ikes ejok a ŋitai kus a daadaŋ ka a akiyar kus a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakoloŋit na, icamunosi iyes ke Ekapolon; aruwor iŋes Akuj kus ka itiyaete iyes ŋuna ecamit iŋes, iwuapitae ŋakiro ŋuna etubunit iŋes, ŋakiciketa, ŋikisila ka iwuapitae ŋakiro keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakoloŋit na, icamunosi iyes ke Ekapolon, iruworosi iyes ŋituŋa keŋ ŋulu emina iŋes nooi, lopite ŋolo ikiikinia iŋes iyes ka iwuapete iyes ŋakiciketa keŋ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikotere ikituruwori iŋes iyes ŋituŋa ŋulu iloito ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin a daadaŋ ŋulu asubuni iŋes, iruworosi iyes ŋulu ikipuritoe, ŋulu arwok ka ŋulu ikitopolooritae ka iruworosi iyes ŋituŋa ŋulu asegak aneni ke Ekapolon Akuj kus, lopite ŋolo eikinitor iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
